      "4. ΔfHSI = ΔTEMP + ΔVDD",
      "5. These values are obtained by using formula: (Freq(3.6 V) - Freq(3.3 V)) / Freq(3.3 V) or (Freq(3.6 V) - Freq(2.7 V)) / Freq(2.7 V).",
